## [Items](items)

### [deep haul](sink_salvage)
---
Type: item/salvage
Art: unknown
Price: 320
---
A thousand years of things that drifted in and never drifted out. Eddy will empty his till.

### [a XORN traffic scrap](clue_traffic)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: unknown
---
Half a XORN routing order, water-ruined and still legible in the places that matter. It
names the yard at (-5, -4), and it names what they were told to cut out of it.

